WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.421 --> 00:00:03.794
Unit six. Being Kind Online!

2
00:00:04.766 --> 00:00:09.474
Hello, everyone! I'm Ms. Emily, your technology teacher.

3
00:00:09.524 --> 00:00:12.188
Hi, Ms. Emily! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:12.238 --> 00:00:15.939
Today we learn about Being Kind Online. Let's go!

5
00:00:17.543 --> 00:00:21.803
Kindness. Say it with me. Kindness!

6
00:00:25.254 --> 00:00:29.979
Digital citizen. Say it with me. Digital citizen!

7
00:00:33.506 --> 00:00:37.302
Respect. Say it with me. Respect!

8
00:00:40.789 --> 00:00:45.689
Online friend. Say it with me. Online friend!

9
00:00:49.206 --> 00:00:53.373
Feelings. Say it with me. Feelings!

10
00:00:56.849 --> 00:01:01.446
Think before you type. Say it with me. Think before you type!

11
00:01:04.963 --> 00:01:09.050
Positive. Say it with me. Positive!

12
00:01:12.498 --> 00:01:16.615
Community. Say it with me. Community!

13
00:01:20.162 --> 00:01:34.209
Being a good digital citizen means showing kindness and respect to everyone online. An online friend has feelings too, so I think before I type. Staying positive helps build a friendly online community.

14
00:01:34.258 --> 00:01:37.334
Now I understand. Thank you, Ms. Emily!

15
00:01:38.086 --> 00:01:43.414
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:43.464 --> 00:01:44.614
Respect!

17
00:01:45.815 --> 00:01:51.175
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:51.225 --> 00:01:52.375
Positive!

19
00:01:53.443 --> 00:02:01.197
Did you know? A kind comment online can make someone's whole day better, just like in real life!

20
00:02:01.247 --> 00:02:03.717
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:02:04.411 --> 00:02:12.692
Think and answer. How can you show kindness when you are online?

22
00:02:12.742 --> 00:02:13.892
Great answer!

23
00:02:14.789 --> 00:02:20.173
Great job today! Keep learning, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:20.223 --> 00:02:23.312
Goodbye, everyone! See you next time!

